    "title": "Angela Answers: Speeding Ticket Troubles - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David Gay ,\n12 hours ago\nINDIANAPOLIS — Every year, hundreds of thousands of people receive speeding tickets in the state of Indiana.\nHowever, what can individuals do if they get a ticket and they were not the ones speeding? That is something that Russell Hughes, a Zionsville man, claims happened to him.\nFOX59 Morning News Anchor Angela Ganote spoke with Hughes, who claims that an Indiana State Trooper told Hughes that he was going 91 in a 70 mph zone. The two spoke about the incident and the process that Hughes has had to go through since then.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Fox 59.\n1",
